---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---
<Page title="Affiliate disclosure" description="How Bright Lives English earns money, and our promise to recommend only courses we believe in." updated="26 September 2026">
  <p>Bright Lives English is free, and we want to keep it that way. To help pay for making new lessons, some pages on this site may contain <strong>affiliate links</strong>.</p>

  <h2>What this means</h2>
  <p>If you click an affiliate link and buy a course or product, we may earn a commission. <strong>This never costs you anything extra.</strong> The price is the same whether you use our link or not.</p>

  <h2>Our promise</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We only recommend courses and tools we believe will genuinely help you learn English.</li>
    <li>A commission never changes our opinion or what we write.</li>
    <li>Posts that contain affiliate links say so clearly at the top.</li>
    <li>All our lessons stay free, with or without affiliate links.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Questions?</h2>
  <p>Email us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. You can read how we handle your information in our <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
</Page>
